{"title":"2.26万亿元！2024粤港澳大湾区全球招商大会达成签约项目1933个！","date":"2024-11-15","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:17.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">2.26</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:17.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">万亿元！<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>粤港澳大湾区全球招商大会达成签约项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">1933</span>个！<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">近日，<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>粤港澳大湾区全球招商大会在广州举行，据悉，<b>本届大会共达成签约项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">1933</span>个、资金总额<span lang=\"EN-US\">2.26</span>万亿元。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">大会遴选了<span lang=\"EN-US\">24</span>个重大项目进行现场签约，包括澳门机场横琴货站项目、希音湾区大旺智慧产业园项目、明阳现代能源高端装备科技园项目、招商局集团科技创新总部项目、江门松下电子元器件项目等。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202411/%E9%A6%96%E5%9B%BE(1).png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">本届大会由粤港澳三地政府联合举办，诚邀全球企业走进大湾区、发掘新商机、共享新机遇。大会采取<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;1+9+N&rdquo;</span>系列活动形式举办，即<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>场主场活动、<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>场珠三角城市招商大会及<span lang=\"EN-US\">N</span>场海内外路演和产业招商活动，得到全球企业的积极响应和大力支持。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">主场活动首次举办专题产业应用场景招商对接活动，围绕人工智能、低空经济、新型储能、生物医药、高端装备等<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>大新质生产力产业，展示场景需求的<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>机会清单<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>和场景应用的<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>能力清单<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>，发布市场潜力大、投资效益好、示范带动强的应用场景，推送新技术、新产品、新业态，促进前沿技术与创新产品落地应用、迭代升级。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">据悉，此前两届招商大会项目已加快落地、开工率达<span lang=\"EN-US\">76.8%</span>、完成投资金额超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>万亿元。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}